cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these programs, formulas, proofs or colourings, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Programs, formulas, proofs and colourings for \"Power-residue colourings and exact Gallai-van der Waerden numbers\""
abstract: "Encoders, CNF formulas with LRAT proofs and their SHA-256 digests, a strict LRAT checker, exhaustive and window searches, prime scans and every colouring behind the determination of the Gallai-van der Waerden numbers GW(r;3,4), GW(r;3,5) and GW(r;4,3) and the lower bound GW(4;4,4) >= 329, with the case files and logs of the 15,914 refutations of the diagonal case."
authors:
